{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71e3f2b5a971e6fcc9d798a68244503edc0d70cbed395779774e1d3250211a18",
      "source_sha256": "3da3f18b5932132a1333e1ac3cfd8667c0555d5129250f777993272585f07d0c",
      "translation": "公主殿下，到头来，您是想为了自己一个人活命，就毁灭这个世界啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:adbed49cea522e5805d9322a11387e8d9825612a635cb9a62abcbac726ca8bb2",
      "source_sha256": "0440b18b11519bccbbcf8b941d56e50c2ca668b6fe4d9639ec375a5c1402db03",
      "translation": "就算我死了，150年后，你们也会再次发动战争吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:97e139a371a5df113993a8195b54c78faef2264dbfcd0923d09204e925dafd78",
      "source_sha256": "f54de64bcc5b6f79c414cd2a987e24ae0330ceaf11008c151a3c5b00b6ce5a47",
      "translation": "我不打算，让这种恶性循环继续下去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:05c6fb83955661f7db20133ddcfd2b6e625402be600a9300ed91edb7f52fb4c9",
      "source_sha256": "93f0d2ecf8600560ccd030e1a3ff8e80399b708bc8e0d7050e86002020064736",
      "translation": "这一切，都是为了守护兰兹海姆。您真自私。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a473d65bdf841ea48378fa09cc7eceb512d5d4142b60503a4b6edf66acc317f",
      "source_sha256": "9d97fe88a0c409f138677223094ad19ccd148f568954db96362d9bada3a80996",
      "translation": "你没资格对我说这种话。自私的人，是你吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:86fd2625663dc0553e05e589cd56205597becd19d053c33ca859563dfe68e2d9",
      "source_sha256": "30c3dd3930b901d2c172ea3c8f8bf133871f1dde60ca5ea23ba6e19029478872",
      "translation": "你沉浸在守护世界的优越感里，却在毁掉这个世界。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c40b38c4f892f6187cd2aa44708d7e44f30d4c2ee5e6b7abf78a526750dd9f1a",
      "source_sha256": "2cc5f569bc724dd5460e7234979c93c5cffe1320016a720ddcf349f0d3a6f1a5",
      "translation": "别想说服我。人们在这座乐园里，生活得很好。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:245a02755c067645d656e3dff7992644fc8a99306d06f1c08e1cce9211f87855",
      "source_sha256": "3760ba1ba813244f89f22f229a1b405e9f3d83bb67bc6ca65626557e00a02f16",
      "translation": "要从他们手中夺走乐园的你们，才是沉浸在守护世界的优越感里吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2586d778fc3a8264c85aff88535f92a8c2961d861edbe2fa833512c3fba5d28a",
      "source_sha256": "873dd59909c934692427e1db437caed60e7008b7bdbe8ae7bcafaed3385646a1",
      "translation": "难道，只因为这个世界靠生命的代价维系，就能断言它是虚假的吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6c0f36f2827a8871b8a506ad6a388cbc02f59811509da4d63c8f69f225ba47dd",
      "source_sha256": "c882e1df9d1c4a22010020db8675e551c5ea6a00570691c7a77eab66c72f2946",
      "translation": "对某些人而言，这也可能是真实的世界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c6addd3cb26f889b9a9eecc2d32a4eccb702634fb6ff595031b3628fadff00ad",
      "source_sha256": "5e04b1b7f3d08c41f7b5c8b296540a7d78c1e42fdd59ffa2fef10f41a32aaded",
      "translation": "是啊，也许如此。说到底，你和我想要守护的世界，就有着根本的不同。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4c44910d878dc3446105ff8cf82e742385629efae0fa2dae4817058560459cf7",
      "source_sha256": "5939baa8593d0a9e63dddadbda076fc7563bbe30c57756738875f508ee625102",
      "translation": "而我们，正是因为相信自己守护的世界是真实的，才开始了这场战斗。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6f4c8c148081a0df99695ac38289d34dc11a93d1947a28f52629cbfd964c7778",
      "source_sha256": "b20b56a0bb4ad634b1812fd691f5bbefb5d1458c7ec7ca373c15b403838d21ad",
      "translation": "克蕾尔，我们会阻止你！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0c874b5d7a648c9f939d96bdafd3ea46b9a11f0b171197f9373e2c01488369ba",
      "source_sha256": "a06652bfa73715453081c689058beceee49fde191c4e477554373ec1d5a0ba9a",
      "translation": "再说下去，也只是浪费时间。不如让彼此的正义，较量一番。怎么样？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be353c38dd731279e77e8af7cf8dc6b6ed276f1ef0928c73595cffc2550b4b20",
      "source_sha256": "294956de49198fb271ef30bbbd6a0b8a013e2c87db67603ad1a3be2aa35f77d5",
      "translation": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:16a43574f6e5e2e4e247140ecfaf104895aafeb7c55dabd567725bd908e168e0",
      "source_sha256": "bdf1b349a40951a4095ad735b9c3388876b46e32ae508152651b5e92287d7e0a",
      "translation": "你们……打算让拉·斯特拉达……坠落吗……？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:83428f9ee612ce38d572858957f578b512d88684f09d86c7cb9c7cd0d1927c9b",
      "source_sha256": "531c126e20834f759ef3f6228379d299d465bb5438ac050206231458923973d5",
      "translation": "你们会受到……全世界的谴责……即使如此，也要做吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e3d887fb970a71cc0359e6b8654af99ab58adf3387cb5923f6c193306a0bcf04",
      "source_sha256": "62e9df05d3457595fa759c1273615aca5d02cb4a96d9b11273ebfc096a43ddf0",
      "translation": "我已经被当作魔女，差点死去。如今也无路可退了，谴责什么的，我并不害怕。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f9a65af3f52a9d511521d319613f5a08304073be9c828f268de45de9129f97c2",
      "source_sha256": "ce9b3bfae494c885ba25d83a786ce1e691a55fc2f316e6fe8be73d91095c8dfa",
      "translation": "要是连这种事都会害怕，我们就不会走到这里了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:68d2d807ce27936793927ad2ba5b77c11490f424a84a77b256f17e8b0e50772e",
      "source_sha256": "4bba72a7fe18911d0f722b27ceb5e7cb4673ecb88a7e264500c621fa63ce4b1b",
      "translation": "只要您死了……就能争取到……一百多年的时间……为什么……要这样？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ce28780680a1821534af488f56253e2db79785a3cce023c6860e90f998373073",
      "source_sha256": "417882e8d755e6d2caa572e764e8ad30b7f92c7ed6e2dd64cacf1166719faf7b",
      "translation": "比起区区百年的乐园，对我们而言，阻止未来诞生的生命继续被牺牲，更加重要。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:635215313990de0f3a21d6d67a5f3b5f7086dc463591f6e624f919fdefcf1719",
      "source_sha256": "50809a7a885c52c86661e8f3e225eb99b5b3c199650bb2db54274472853f7791",
      "translation": "是啊。照这样下去，兰兹海姆就要永远流血。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:74c5d6864bdcb0a6b959a94c6441df03a449ea17a25896fe93379543cfc5cd01",
      "source_sha256": "8e5fd09667d46148231dae22b0386ce49c24f4a74ac6cd605f1d2902f9ff19da",
      "translation": "我不明白……你们竟然……想再次回到……不毛之地。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f51ab0cbe224e59c3cddd577c720738c3530e6eef820c1f7c641f3f95be14b1",
      "source_sha256": "32a1c5ee748cd01ea3125c92853931d18ebab30a298781377478c09f1cf1fcb2",
      "translation": "那才是，这个世界真正的模样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d843ea7d1a4faa089bff36bba2f5c1e67637eaba89684289f639c242f6cdaf3",
      "source_sha256": "3e1a9e844d4b0da92f242dac52a79af40f49b5c5a00717250804cef72c365b03",
      "translation": "要是摧毁拉·斯特拉达……你们会后悔的……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3fe834ba23dc364eeb93c45da7e6a5b5afab4716d202b7340469123b6f723d70",
      "source_sha256": "7e9e39e57be20f6c542d39a5701568f69d0fa45feceb08d6b30e4ae663e09be4",
      "translation": "无论发生什么，我都不会后悔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:04bef99a24b27043b64eaec0edbb4dd529e2ddc72c221838696e7de4fc0a4ce9",
      "source_sha256": "4d905d1b1f533922f13cfc387b7edf21982fc73b4ca625a75acefd63726898e0",
      "translation": "你并不明白……我的话……是什么意思吧……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a0327b2578efa2f11966352620d876ec9683463d4e7d2c8e6d3ec5e8e66a737e",
      "source_sha256": "a33c8554b5f68a75584f0c0bcf2ff5f7892e001693f7cc6b565b3ba5240635b1",
      "translation": "不，我很清楚。因为，我早就做好觉悟了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8dfb93acd2b74330667394fccfe7361b16298f9b2faaa79b58b6c3d0adc4c922",
      "source_sha256": "1f2a338720fb85d41dd94140b2616bd793196df45f0e05d22b1bf65550d3f829",
      "translation": "……呼……真愚蠢啊……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8d79981ed3311d3e22cee44ae33c4b17de29f1c6c493dcce3530b2483ee37067",
      "source_sha256": "73154471e261a8fb38bb9779ece315342c79c5d9cfc217f0c2c1778119a714fa",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特大人……我没能……阻止他们……请您……原谅……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9ad2708baed67dc63dc540f390a1a3a18b43b2b5b34a63cb67cd9d4af9477753",
      "source_sha256": "032a37fdb6508843b2b07b2c56ed2ff258727a641723ff7d0568f81375ba5888",
      "translation": "如今，只剩下修恩扎伊特了吗……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:63d864a482986fb0b050fa80524b26d62019890abf06da84cc6f1dae73a307b7",
      "source_sha256": "9007f9a96b7f354ad05bab679466ba16914699526687fb5360dcc7e8d6b54895",
      "translation": "他一定在等我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:01725f01d449f77ede03a11a5c1fbc56fbaeb173f8f7f4963794b428b89b1ad5",
      "source_sha256": "fcae8a14d1fbc47d97bd7248532233e0cd6c36226b82bb0edf9f143d055e7793",
      "translation": "这是最后一战。大家，做好觉悟吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bcd6a38fc84c12d084426fde59bf090de2bc05608d92d68d81bd44715bad9afb",
      "source_sha256": "fedc76b5c2bcbb2c5f36c8af3d966320ce85eb885f95c00d22fa27a56ec23998",
      "translation": "可是，我们能赢吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5a8e2b9515f8067b42c8c8886d954202a820ca52ba5d8f999b9438d09f1fe336",
      "source_sha256": "e0847bff68e3c0adcc696095e0c1dd452b527ea52aa6351f1b231474f413bb21",
      "translation": "不是“能赢吗”，而是“一定要赢”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:30cd6c6314e6e8cbc95b6769089c20b15f3f3cd2ac5a532abaa15f64d075ceb6",
      "source_sha256": "6f6262c3d904e7b6f829caa387c0ab9f617a5eb0bed241531aff204893866503",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀，别担心。会没事的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:726d53d8544143ad1c5ddcbb758ed92e73e391ca5ca7e6dae121dac22cc66958",
      "source_sha256": "d80e1ebc7caa88a218b627d3ae024323b9c9af718a764f27209f98a73124f58e",
      "translation": "嗯，阿尔戈哥哥！都已经走到这里了！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a29a0e1bc7b8e9f676ae23783ed410185b5d2aabc5505d618a147f0c400a2b29",
      "source_sha256": "b83a5eb13a82955298717dfe281645fffacc24b88d16ba83ad1f651e0008144b",
      "translation": "不过，绝不能掉以轻心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a214da6e423c9d063aa5fbe5477b5ec65a31b1ac9b0ab5e676ab958542f37b24",
      "source_sha256": "a4f485c925cbc7f10618cf767637cde01b3f1badc0c22fd409620e9679004efd",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特至今，从未展露过真正的实力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5a1b63acc2d0834c096de1c720f1f47213199f668ae02cbed7c55002f7191ff5",
      "source_sha256": "5f267bcaa7e400ea68a2289229f5b3c7b73cce0cf1d8e6c6a689fe83e76df12c",
      "translation": "是啊。大家都得小心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c32ea3e7b125a431fff4482e5f39d33f15aae57d08e07d80f90fd80d47e4156a",
      "source_sha256": "ec2d9ac31462728ef9b828560f6de3510b9adab0ce2f31363358365bee03d62f",
      "translation": "我希望，我们所有人，都能平安回到地面。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:28886be523d28ce47ff98bd52a64a3f58dbaccc0cdfd48f9afa04c9398f483d6",
      "source_sha256": "45cadcdd0538e0994b2c3a4612ab28a547e530b47bf3a8ec48f01f6a6acb989f",
      "translation": "别担心，公主殿下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3489337e4d4efccef414a88b91980024262469208707793a16a1eb7ae63a20f5",
      "source_sha256": "83d73190a13e815c99d75548f16cd5ffc871103edbfd8ec47400f22ecf188be3",
      "translation": "那不是我们部队的目标吗？我可没忘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5965de3bcb5443daaffc77667c070b64086067f552845d1ac4fcf1ed77136098",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2ef4b9971e71240b9bef5b265d766fc8e7f62a682353c84259f8c80e7a433ed2",
      "source_sha256": "4ce126f3533de182d6954adede54e5dcd17980d01ff8e9600cc1207acbf4e37a",
      "translation": "这下……真的到最后了呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0165f132c4ed44fdeec3e832b5bdfab52f60da49cf5660d92cdc8d5ecf289588",
      "source_sha256": "620b1b306d40309a7647efef59661a3a52fc159e19f34da3925a82967fe1b977",
      "translation": "这场战斗结束后，乐园便会消失，人们一定会对我们指指点点吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b88e4cc26da92420fdc0cb7cc67153f141a99628c1cfbf63028c109686e9d58a",
      "source_sha256": "2045272bd659df5467843f072c1f3b2f9a4d4ea39fdaefcc0a41341a9f45a288",
      "translation": "明明已经能清楚地看见，那样艰辛的未来，不知为何，我却感到一种奇妙的畅快。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ddc674d69cbed98ed042794938a744657b55ed29b71b1a0b557bcfa89a3975b2",
      "source_sha256": "d807f18d0bb6d0ff561e51df4eb07c71de28d68dd9cb90231da2c37fb20aa1e5",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀，拜托你了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:19d8064353130bca1fb311bcf70a394f26afa7ff314287f6f8964f535f2d422b",
      "source_sha256": "02bdc45cfba6b614b909dfc7390f3cc09eff94246080ffc7e2c1058025c5d231",
      "translation": "知道啦～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dbb725ecb2f787f5bd6e0644aea891393621101ebdd0e34a3ccee2ab6e45bb6f",
      "source_sha256": "f277bdb512605585fc39f10d61ef9c3fa65f1602e046cc46308d78bf7915d77d",
      "translation": "这里是王之关卡。想要通过此处，就出示4个“王之证明”吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8b3e4f34fdc65175ac757d88640825a9688f53813f2bc592aee2bc2eb449f670",
      "source_sha256": "a67065eb2f11d9a0a70f15531d315360fedfacd149a9fd0788171a899f894342",
      "translation": "已经拥有王之证明的人，应当能轻松通过。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71dffa3f2ed7c3328bd84c7716623116111375a53fa42ee25d8cb7f0dac61b66",
      "source_sha256": "031305317224bf8f7af9566740584cae9540eae908dcc52fb10eb9dfcd6d0ff7",
      "translation": "但尚未拥有的人，必须在这里接受“王之试炼”，证明自己为王。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5f5d19969513a96b8e676f579d84388ff354f5a0e617fc0c1920034c38aaf3e0",
      "source_sha256": "117a961f16d9bdefd9370e9d98dd8c5accf6ada22e5a90c69920edfbadb35f59",
      "translation": "所谓王之试炼，就是走遍王之关卡中的4个房间，取得证明。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d9a9c58a54b81a91fa7759c6392df040ec9eb1253024c1881a9b46271d965a61",
      "source_sha256": "0181d68cf33b7b5aca7ceebdfbf72c3acf27c5a0773323a820f3f5f0cb89c83a",
      "translation": "集齐4个王之证明后，再回到这里吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c7ab82cb447df6e2b225892d53c153c22fa4d28bb06f2901a4bad2be1ad9aae0",
      "source_sha256": "eb4b8b2a38091132c6ca763797df65eb6ea98114c69565778d69f4db57bf2311",
      "translation": "只要克服全部试炼，就能通过最后一道关卡，前往拉·斯特拉达的中心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:87defe70a262699c0efb9e4f93d64080fae46563c3759f7a8da157cfdcb8e8c6",
      "source_sha256": "d55af5afddc3fb2ad9bfb66ce848f46064af3f5d3438a697659106230c7423ab",
      "translation": "洁菲已经获得证明，应该能直接通过了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bd00fc1b51a5b3faaf5b8b938d781dbedae82aec514342d84fe701f41db8cdbd",
      "source_sha256": "35ee2dbe01bbe37198e7f0700240ae7ed45ed73364ba331faf8bb61096660df2",
      "translation": "拉·斯特拉达的中心……最后一战，终于就在眼前了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d4bc33ee7b7c5857af0bbe7a71b37b035360695560a006be0ac7c78afdbdc89e",
      "source_sha256": "133aed08e12b535673f4f57dd96db97b025a9f1bd2b7e6e12a105c379071fc1f",
      "translation": "打倒修恩扎伊特，守护这个世界吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fc51c254c706174b600609c096ca493ffe532d9bf2540305dc72c825d62a701f",
      "source_sha256": "91073f8f8e8b444969f69b56da8ec4e1cd13dcbe99bfae15ab7259ec6389e91c",
      "translation": "嗯。如今，必须斩断拉·斯特拉达的束缚。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2b1dbdf85aa4e4a8fd57431ed1cd9a8ddf9489536943f8780d3e624f61236476",
      "source_sha256": "57a5a79d1c78139e2143963e71500482946099447528f72f06604e322e4989d7",
      "translation": "唔，集齐所有王之证明后，就是最后一战了？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f6ab5b450e4e97d7969b4cfc58f73e7941795300fc783637461e9e4b8d0d83b7",
      "source_sha256": "5615e9c4824cc5c5aee61e19084dd5289d999834dc9c063c0ba12b196d69e421",
      "translation": "嗯。通过王之关卡后，修恩扎伊特应该就在那里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:398dc96175c1bfd9094d7245b02c6840ede389cebc6f8eface3199b65adee909",
      "source_sha256": "e577140e31a8e164e822ad8fcc8e605bc708b166e1e2f0b8797f95767ccbb820",
      "translation": "好，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5c4e522b2d96700754d4cf4a7d2e98bdbc72ef8f67b2a04e0a258ad959eded78",
      "source_sha256": "8025c713f26164a6787608a6cbce1b8ac0cfe963a42e1416578db60193e95224",
      "translation": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:368a71efcf2aa3f8012260bfe533cad0e3522ae5d0fc9467b9dfb828741927fa",
      "source_sha256": "8846f2fe8aa0587462bfe0cfbf0c504c02ec8fb1c19bae9f7992c1ca21f3a6ba",
      "translation": "做得很好……拉·斯特拉达，已承认你为王……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:75e990eb2a7289e7ad2feb5a24a7d5e8e1a727291e5bd726a03a886e6794f528",
      "source_sha256": "428ffe71b048f67c423689d65cef7c1cf06a03a54f081854ae07af7d3e8a0230",
      "translation": "愿好运与你同在……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:90727b91c77f46034b7eeb9ec17bedd1e0174c2e91e2dcc0d0a4e678b26c130b",
      "source_sha256": "a044060028d9141b4f54ce21b4dbc42b6d3281a334cbac51b014dee64e35b3a6",
      "translation": "终于走到这里了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:25649174b591ae5b3a3e2d0612929df38170c5d18ee9b13d328b45a1ffe44bf2",
      "source_sha256": "e3c6dd2f35edf363091e4e75dbcaae1c23e0d67b80dfc141158ef908b10c8d75",
      "translation": "嗯，终于到最后了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4714a5b975d06bd335ba89b0a1e1b3d56c4afbb5356fcbddc7303c599f5f6b57",
      "source_sha256": "1d029dca9b0f9602bbe161c5147de2dc2eacf2bab8dff98bd61151681aa6867f",
      "translation": "走吧。大家，做好觉悟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea744e478e05f3fd3a4e0f51f4737d2e8c49487353511b35ca49a1aeaf991d18",
      "source_sha256": "47dd1707211c7354d813fcd6c66319369aef44dca3d28aedf2278035f5fb055c",
      "translation": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:001e22e71b9eda2da22e9a12475377f05464dd077e74ce61eb1ed3f329f46d38",
      "source_sha256": "7e9b84d9d37b66f056db796e3d3540e911eae283e08615a7d560491555469673",
      "translation": "王之证明 (1/4)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:53fbce5b1f9c40e703484d5a08a86792a12ed9fa85c478f1960d441478f4cb43",
      "source_sha256": "998fb5757652a5c6294ef68a77b2de550ad88e561c0047c4995249b949e266cf",
      "translation": "王之证明 (2/4)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cc9446ad42439f8a70db1dfc6f573f104e43312bf169bcf9e005b7fe1465e4f5",
      "source_sha256": "ba0d3f0b6c1c100bacc0490b0d7f283c96d55f387ab9ddb19fffd726236d2823",
      "translation": "王之证明 (3/4)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:04b6578caf6438ad835e3f4eb7678f5000201f57a1fa30ace204f3f9e12f8af4",
      "source_sha256": "e7821484cd53e63ca94b4f4727a4c2fd05abb18dbf1154a4cf071df4b6915c4b",
      "translation": "王之证明 (4/4)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:59dcee2d90c663c7e9016f2c79562371a9bc1f4e84a95d19eb633010e90afff4",
      "source_sha256": "a81f91341e1a090c05190cf37837cbe2567c435427a4b843d27e452ac1f35f85",
